# The staging copy (DEPLOY.md, "Staging"), used by `npm run deploy:staging`. Public addresses only, no secrets.
# The staging server (Render service mudawwrah-staging), ending in /api. The deploy refuses a server that does not
# report itself as staging.
VITE_API_URL=https://mudawwrah-staging.onrender.com/api
# The fixed address every staging deploy is given. The staging server's STOREFRONT_URL and CORS_ORIGINS use it.
STAGING_ALIAS=mudawarah-staging.vercel.app
